            "value" : "その文字にはすでにショートカットがあります。別の文字を選択してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That letter is already in use, so KeyPath left your launcher untouched. Choose another letter and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Safe conflict message when an onboarding launcher shortcut cannot be added.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That letter is already in use, so KeyPath left your launcher untouched. Choose another letter and try again."
          }
